      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0,
          "end": 2.19,
          "en": "[Maximilian Schwarzmüller] So let's now handle",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.19,
          "end": 4.56,
          "en": "the submission of this forum.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.56,
          "end": 9.33,
          "en": "And for that I'll go to my user input component HTML file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.33,
          "end": 11.16,
          "en": "and they are on the forum.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.16,
          "end": 14.85,
          "en": "We can listen to an event about which you learned earlier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.85,
          "end": 17.01,
          "en": "in the essentials section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.01,
          "end": 20.043,
          "en": "We can listen to the ngSubmit event,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.91,
          "end": 23.91,
          "en": "or at least we almost can.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.91,
          "end": 25.41,
          "en": "Right now I can't",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.41,
          "end": 29.25,
          "en": "because this is not a default browser event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.25,
          "end": 32.13,
          "en": "Instead, this is an event that's triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.13,
          "end": 35.839,
          "en": "four form elements by Angular,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.839,
          "end": 40.839,
          "en": "but only after we imported and unlocked, so to say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.46,
          "end": 44.76,
          "en": "a certain Angular feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.76,
          "end": 49.05,
          "en": "To be precise in the component that wants to use ngSubmit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.05,
          "end": 54.05,
          "en": "we have to add the forms module to our imports array here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.99,
          "end": 57.18,
          "en": "and to make it available in this file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 57.18,
          "end": 59.34,
          "en": "we actually also have to add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 59.34,
          "end": 63.873,
          "en": "the import at the top of the file from @Angular forms.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.1,
          "end": 69.09,
          "en": "This module includes a couple of important things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.09,
          "end": 73.26,
          "en": "For example, an extension of the default form element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 73.26,
          "end": 74.73,
          "en": "if you want to call it like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.73,
          "end": 78.09,
          "en": "that unlocks this ngSubmit event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 78.09,
          "end": 79.56,
          "en": "So now we can listen to that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 79.56,
          "end": 81.993,
          "en": "with that event binding syntax here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 83.13,
          "end": 86.49,
          "en": "Now I also of course, need to define what should happen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 86.49,
          "end": 88.23,
          "en": "when that event occurs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.23,
          "end": 91.62,
          "en": "and here I want to add a new method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.62,
          "end": 95.19,
          "en": "to that user input component class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 95.19,
          "end": 96.93,
          "en": "onSubmit could be the name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 96.93,
          "end": 99.53999999999999,
          "en": "though, of course the name is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 99.53999999999999,
          "end": 101.46000000000001,
          "en": "And with that method added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 101.46000000000001,
          "end": 105.36,
          "en": "in the template of this component where we added the method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.36,
          "end": 109.563,
          "en": "we can now call onSubmit when that event occurs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 110.91,
          "end": 112.443,
          "en": "So that's how we connect this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 113.97,
          "end": 116.34,
          "en": "Now to see whether this works or not,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 116.34,
          "end": 120.3,
          "en": "Inside of onSubmit, we can console log,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 120.3,
          "end": 122.373,
          "en": "submit it, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 124.17,
          "end": 127.83,
          "en": "With that added, if you open the developer tools",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 127.83,
          "end": 130.41,
          "en": "and they are the JavaScript console,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 130.41,
          "end": 134.913,
          "en": "if you click calculate, now you should see submitted here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 136.68,
          "end": 139.65,
          "en": "So that's an important step in the right direction.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 139.65,
          "end": 143.37,
          "en": "As a next step, I want to use two-way binding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 143.37,
          "end": 145.47,
          "en": "to get hold of the values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 145.47,
          "end": 148.083,
          "en": "that have been entered into these fields.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
